g Python-only 15-second floor on every platform while preserving configured budgets for other commands.","messageHeadline":"fix(agent): floor Python startup budget","oid":"a4774b231b1f3d2401c24749c59db2987af8edd3"},{"authoredDate":"2026-08-15T03:15:24Z","authors":[{"email":"drakonard@gmail.com","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","login":"konard","name":"konard"}],"committedDate":"2026-08-15T03:15:24Z","messageBody":"","messageHeadline":"test(self-hosting): require end-to-end loop","oid":"3add82a99351dbc3cf2fa53ce9539ef94d70df0b"},{"authoredDate":"2026-08-15T03:17:58Z","authors":[{"email":"drakonard@gmail.com","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","login":"konard","name":"konard"}],"committedDate":"2026-08-15T03:17:58Z","messageBody":"A single attributed commit previously qualified a mixed-authorship pull request. Require valid session evidence and the matching PR trailer on every non-merge commit introduced by the reviewed merge.","messageHeadline":"fix(release): require end-to-end AI PRs","oid":"91669b4290d5706c84b82c8816077b1561bade58"},{"authoredDate":"2026-08-15T03:41:29Z","authors":[{"email":"drakonard@gmail.com","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","login":"konard","name":"konard"}],"committedDate":"2026-08-15T03:41:29Z","messageBody":"A parent retry can destroy effects already verified through all split children. Pin the failure before teaching incremental dispatch to accept a verified composition.","messageHeadline":"test(orchestration): reproduce composed regression","oid":"c8d6cdbd4f50001817f8498f85d71a82df040c1c"},{"authoredDate":"2026-08-15T03:45:55Z","authors":[{"email":"drakonard@gmail.com","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","login":"konard","name":"konard"}],"committedDate":"2026-08-15T03:45:55Z","messageBody":"Recheck composed child effects against the parent verifier before invoking a mutating agent again. Record that decision as replayable verification evidence and keep it out of agent-learning observations.","messageHeadline":"fix(orchestration): preserve verified composition","o